  <section id="faq" class="band band-grain" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
    <div class="faq-top"><div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 id="faq-h" style="margin-top:14px">Good questions.</h2>
      <p class="lede">What members ask before their first booking.</p></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="acc glass"><details name="faq" open><summary><span>Who can join?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>Anyone. Time Xchange is built for professionals, and open to everyone: households, students, teachers and community groups. Every member’s time counts the same way.</p></div></details><details name="faq"><summary><span>Do I have to trade with the same person who helped me?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>No. Time you earn from one member can be spent with anyone in the network. Most time changes hands several times: an accountant pays an architect, who pays a photographer, who pays an engineer.</p></div></details><details name="faq"><summary><span>What if a session runs over?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>The requester chooses: stop at the reserved time, or allow paid overtime from their available balance.</p></div></details><details name="faq"><summary><span>Do I need to earn time before I can book?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>No. Every plan includes an allowance, so you can book your first session straight away.</p></div></details><details name="faq"><summary><span>What can I pay with?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>Time, for most bookings. When both sides agree, you can add cash on top, for example to cover materials or a specialist rate, or a real gift to say thanks, like gold, wine, vouchers, books, shoes or food.</p></div></details><details name="faq"><summary><span>Are there hidden fees?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>No hidden fees between members: you pay only what you agree, in time, plus any cash or gift. Memberships are billed separately through the App Store and Google Play. [Confirm the fee wording before launch.]</p></div></details><details name="faq"><summary><span>Can I cancel a booking?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" class="chev" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. You can cancel or reschedule in the app. If you cancel a booking that has started, any unpaid work goes to the provider and the rest of the reserved time returns to you.</p></div></details></div>
      <div class="faq-side">
        <form class="ask-q glass" id="askQ" novalidate>
          <div class="aq-head"><span class="help-ic"><svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z" /></svg></span><div><b>Still have a question?</b><p>Ask us and the support team will reply by email.</p></div></div>
          <label for="aqText">Your question</label>
          <textarea id="aqText" rows="4" maxlength="1000" placeholder="For example: can my company sign up as a group?" required></textarea>
          <label for="aqEmail">Your email</label>
          <input id="aqEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
          <div class="aq-foot"><small id="aqMsg" aria-live="polite">Opens your email app, addressed to support@timexchange.co.za.</small><button class="btn primary sm" type="submit"><svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z" /><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939" /></svg>Send question</button></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


